WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:06.566
First, most big computer failures happen at the handoffs between teams or parts, not inside them.

2
00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:12.138
Second, the cause is usually a guess nobody wrote down, like which units a number uses.

3
00:00:12.478 --> 00:00:18.732
Third, when every handoff guess is written down and machine-checked, a fix in one place stays fixed.
